    {
      "ja": "全世界のガンプラファンにむけた、公式ガンプラ総合施設「ガンダムベース」の限定ガンプラです。",
      "en": "A limited edition Gunpla at the official Gunpla facility \"Gundam Base\" for Gunpla fans around the world."
    },
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士ガンダム UC』エピソード７の最終局面で登場した究極の形態、ユニコーンガンダム（光の結晶体）が初キット化。結晶体の複雑な形状を、新規造形で緻密に再現。ラメ入りクリアブラックの台座、新規の手首パーツも付属。",
      "en": "Unicorn Gundam (crystal of light), the ultimate form that appeared in the final phase of \"Mobile Suit Gundam UC\" Episode 7, is now available as a kit for the first time. The complex shape of the crystal is precisely reproduced with new modeling. A clear black pedestal with glitter and new wrist parts are also included."
    }
